{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:00 2026-09-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:00 2026-09-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:00 2026-09-11 HKT</p><p>已解散的支聯會、前正副主席李卓人、何俊仁和鄒幸彤被控煽動他人顛覆國家政權罪，今早被法庭判處分別監禁7年、5年2個月及7年3個月。保安局局長鄧炳強今日（11日）下午將會見傳媒，料回應支聯會顛覆案判刑。</p><img alt=\"巿民在法院外排隊情況。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/7bf4fe57181e780b89294e75ec8abd4c/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260911_080946912_05.jpg\"/><img alt=\"囚車抵達法院。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/91e14825afa6316e974ad8ef61c83e90/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260911_083409501_01.jpg\"/><img alt=\"鄒幸彤母親。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/79510b26f37724ef59bd96f0d054f227/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260911_093213404_05.jpg\"/><img alt=\"李卓人太太散庭後離庭。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d003d56127937278deae8ed85a97100f/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260911_111332400_09.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8bdd2021faadef18b78b24ba52f6b846/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260911_111332400_03.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ab6b7f7e7641880f0b486b9a43e75e92/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260911_111332400_12.jpg\"/><img alt=\"外國領事代表到庭旁聽。陳浩元攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2d23b8545c0f85d0f430af416d98599c/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260911_094520192_07.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T08:21:10.948010+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}